Package: totaljs-openbox
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: totaljs-wallpapers (>= 1.0.0), xorg, openbox, obconf, tint2, picom, rofi, dunst, libnotify-bin, feh, alacritty,
 pcmanfm, gvfs, xarchiver, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter, lxappearance, papirus-icon-theme, adwaita-icon-theme-full,
 librsvg2-common, shared-mime-info, fonts-firacode, fonts-noto, gsimplecal, python3, python3-xdg, network-manager, network-manager-gnome,
 policykit-1-gnome, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, alsa-utils, pavucontrol, pasystray, dbus-x11, xdg-utils,
 x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, xdotool, scrot, mesa-utils, libgl1-mesa-dri, libglx-mesa0, plymouth-label
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: The Openbox desktop of the Total.js Developer Distros
 Openbox with its own theme (graphite and the green of Total.js), the panel Tint2, the launcher Rofi,
 notifications, the compositor picom, the terminal Alacritty, the files of PCManFM, and the login screen
 of LightDM. The configuration of each person is copied from /etc/skel when the person is created;
 the first time that a person is already there, copy it by hand (the package says how in its postinst).
